solution:
**Given:**

Two numbers are 0.03 and 0.0003

**Formula used:**

Mean Proportion = sqrt{ab}

**Calculation:**

The two numbers are 0.03 and 0.0003

⇒ Mean Proportion = sqrt{ab} = sqrt{0.03times 0.0003} 

⇒ Mean Proportion = sqrt{0.000009}

⇒ Mean Proportion = 0.003

**∴ The mean proportional between 0.03 and 0.0003 is 0.003**
